  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion achieves high accuracy (config_020: 0.725). This experiment tests replacing the RNA encoder with scgpt while keeping other components the same, isolating the effect of the RNA representation. It balances exploration of new encoders with exploitation of the current top-performing setup, addressing uncertainty about whether newer encoders (scgpt) could improve performance without changing multiple parameters."
